      "version": 717,
      "versionNonce": 628354168,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791173874997,
      "created": 1791172329163,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "* tmux - Terminal Multiplexer \n- manage multiple terminal tasks in a single workspace\n- improves session stability - logs & command execution\n\n* git - artifact version control\n- Multiple agents work on different branches.\n\n* jq - simplify JSON processing\n- automation scripts, CI/CD pipelines, API Integrations\n\n* pgrep - simplifies process discovery in Linux env with low\noverhead.\n\n* ss - analyszes network connections\n",
      "fontSize": 15.6954326923077,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "* tmux - Terminal Multiplexer \n- manage multiple terminal tasks in a single workspace\n- improves session stability - logs & command execution\n\n* git - artifact version control\n- Multiple agents work on different branches.\n\n* jq - simplify JSON processing\n- automation scripts, CI/CD pipelines, API Integrations\n\n* pgrep - simplifies process discovery in Linux env with low overhead.\n\n* ss - analyszes network connections\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
